    "created_at": "2016-02-12T20:40:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-02-12T20:40:41Z",
    "body": "Chrome:\n- When the ID contains \"\\f\", the reconnection request contains a Last-Event-ID header with the received ID.\n- When the ID contains \"\\0\", the reconnection request contains a Last-Event-ID header with a trimmed value (e.g. If \"abc\\0def\" was received, \"abc\" will be sent).\n\nFirefox:\n- When the ID contains \"\\f\", the reconnection request contains a Last-Event-ID header with the received ID.\n- When the ID contains \"\\0\", the reconnection request doesn't contain a Last-Event-ID header.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/183481012/reactions",
