    "created_at": "2016-03-17T05:54:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-29T03:47:39Z",
    "body": "Both are acceptable, but I'm leaning towards ignoring an **id** field containing non-VCHARs. It looks consistent with the fact that we ignore an invalid **retry** field and other unrecognized fields.\n",
